<section aria-labelledby="benefits-title" class="border-t border-charcoal/10 py-20 sm:py-28"><div class="container-soft grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-6"><div class="reveal lg:col-span-5"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-soft bg-oat-soft"><img alt="The pink Nolla Nuv Velvet Blanket draped over a boucle armchair by a sunny window." class="object-cover" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 38vw, 100vw" src="{{ 'nuv-pink-draped.webp' | asset_img_url: '1600x' }}" srcset="{{ 'nuv-pink-draped.webp' | asset_img_url: '600x' }} 600w, {{ 'nuv-pink-draped.webp' | asset_img_url: '1000x' }} 1000w, {{ 'nuv-pink-draped.webp' | asset_img_url: '1600x' }} 1600w, {{ 'nuv-pink-draped.webp' | asset_img_url: '2400x' }} 2400w" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 lg:pt-6"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Why it belongs at home</p><h2 class="headline mt-4 max-w-[16ch]" id="benefits-title">Made to be used every day, not saved for best.</h2></div><ol class="mt-10 border-t border-charcoal/10"><li class="reveal grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-x-4 border-b border-charcoal/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif text-[0.95rem] font-light tabular-nums text-taupe">01</span><div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.35rem] font-light tracking-[-0.015em]">A surface you keep touching</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[46ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">Deep, rippled faux fur with real texture. Soft enough that your hand finds it without thinking.</p></div></li><li class="reveal grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-x-4 border-b border-charcoal/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr]" style="transition-delay:60ms"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif text-[0.95rem] font-light tabular-nums text-taupe">02</span><div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.35rem] font-light tracking-[-0.015em]">Sized generously</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[46ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">From a 100 × 150 cm throw to a 200 × 230 cm blanket big enough to share.</p></div></li><li class="reveal grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-x-4 border-b border-charcoal/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr]" style="transition-delay:120ms"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif text-[0.95rem] font-light tabular-nums text-taupe">03</span><div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.35rem] font-light tracking-[-0.015em]">Sofa, bed, armchair</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[46ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">Over your knees, across the bed, around your shoulders. It moves with you.</p></div></li><li class="reveal grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-x-4 border-b border-charcoal/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr]" style="transition-delay:180ms"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif text-[0.95rem] font-light tabular-nums text-taupe">04</span><div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.35rem] font-light tracking-[-0.015em]">Six calm colours</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[46ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">White, Coffee, Pink, Green, Grey and Black, chosen to sit softly in a lived-in home.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section>

